            </div>
            <br>
            <p>Deep in the Owayee Mountains lies the legend of the Ghost Stallion. When travelers are wandering accross the vast landscape with no hope of survival, the Ghost Stallion comes by, leading them to saftey. This show tells the tale of the Ghost Stallion, with music inspired by spaghetti western films as well as snippets of the Rite of Spring by Igor Stravinsky. Once the Ghost Stallion arrives, the darkness is left behind and Gustav Mahler's 5th symphony is played alongside Hector Berlioz' Symphony Fantastique.</p>
