            <p>This season was also the year that the corps song was found. "With All Thanks" was originally arranged as a thank you note to donors who gave the corps a brand new trailer. After consideration, the piece became the corps song, a mixture of "Be Thou My Vision" and "Amazing Grace," 2 favorite hymns of the trailer donors.</p>
